{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0224E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加是中美洲最早扎根民主主义的国家。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"虽然也发生过政变和独裁，但没有发展到大混乱的程度。直到26年前……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"AUX_FIRST_CLAUSES_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"内战吧。你的祖父母也因此去世了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"听说起因是围绕总统选举是否存在舞弊发生了争执。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"为什么只因为这种事，伙伴之间就非得互相争斗呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"明明坐下来谈谈就能解决的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"是啊……要是能做到就好了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"直到现在，还有建筑留着内战时的弹痕。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"即使过去了四分之一个世纪，对<R=哥斯达黎加人,Tico>来说也是无法忘记……不，是绝不能忘记的事。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=哥斯达黎加人,Tico>","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"军队是在内战后的第二年被宪法废除的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}